{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Midnight Taco</strong> is a short psychological horror experience that will immerse you in a chilling atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480930/extras/atmosphere-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1742575893\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of a young girl who must face solitude and mystery while waiting for her mother at the taco stand where she works. It\u2019s a rainy night, but that won\u2019t stop some unwelcome visitors from showing up...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Do you dare to spend a night at the stand?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3480930?t=1742575893","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742575893","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480930/a3b81e18310e730249782219caccbeae64e1f6f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742575893","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480930/a3b81e18310e730249782219caccbeae64e1f6f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742575893","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Midnight Taco</strong> is a short psychological horror experience that will immerse you in a chilling atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_